ai "Scatback"
about "Makes the first man miss and bounces it outside looking for the home run."
position RB
dials vision 0.7 patience 0.25 aggression 0.4 discipline 0.3

rules:
  when with the ball and one man to beat -> juke
  when with the ball and crowd ahead and behind the line -> bounce outside
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  when before the throw and route done and not i am open -> settle in the gap
  otherwise -> follow assignment
